@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam linetype polyline
hide empty description

[*] --> Scheduled : created with a start in the future
[*] --> Active : created, start reached
Scheduled --> Active : start time reached
Active --> Expired : end time reached
Scheduled --> Revoked : revoked
Active --> Revoked : revoked
Expired --> [*]
Revoked --> [*]

note right of Revoked
  A revoked delegation stays in the table
  as history; its activekey becomes its own id,
  so the same pair can be delegated again.
end note

@enduml
